Dialogue: 0,00:04:09.95,00:04:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Claire.
Dialogue: 0,00:04:26.40,00:04:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss you.
Dialogue: 0,00:05:35.47,00:05:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck: Dr. Weir,
Dialogue: 0,00:05:36.87,00:05:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,report to the Lewis & Clark 
in docking bay four.
Dialogue: 0,00:05:57.12,00:05:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin: Ion drive set.
Dialogue: 0,00:05:58.79,00:06:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Smith: Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:01.63,00:06:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Heading, vector one, 
nine degrees.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:09.97,00:06:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We are prepped for lockdown.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:16.91,00:06:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it, 
this is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:19.51,00:06:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't got more than my hand in 
the last six weeks,
Dialogue: 0,00:06:21.65,00:06:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and now this shit.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:24.58,00:06:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, why can't we go to Mars, 
captain?
Dialogue: 0,00:06:26.59,00:06:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, Mars has got women.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:29.55,00:06:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Smith's right.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:31.09,00:06:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Neptune, 
there's nothing out there.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:32.86,00:06:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Smith: Yeah, and if the shit goes 
down, we'll be on our own.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:35.19,00:06:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the rules, people.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:37.03,00:06:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone drops the ball, 
we get the call.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:39.10,00:06:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:41.57,00:06:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you got our course plotted in? 
Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:43.44,00:06:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Locked and cooked 
and ready to rock.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:45.00,00:06:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Justin?
Dialogue: 0,00:06:47.51,00:06:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's green 
on my screen, skipper.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:49.17,00:06:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: 
Start your countdown now.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:50.41,00:06:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ion drive will engage 
in t minus 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:53.85,00:06:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:55.38,00:06:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Smith, you follow me.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:58.05,00:06:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Smith: Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,00:06:59.75,00:07:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Justin, 
get those tanks prepped.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:01.42,00:07:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin: Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:06.53,00:07:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Cooper. Cooper: Skipper.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:08.26,00:07:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ion drive in 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:09.73,00:07:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, it's time to play 
spam-in-the-can.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:11.73,00:07:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Skipper. Miller: Peters.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:15.03,00:07:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Miller, I just wanted to say 
this is something...
Dialogue: 0,00:07:17.04,00:07:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Clock is ticking, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:21.24,00:07:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You waiting for a personal 
invitation, there, Mr. Smith?
Dialogue: 0,00:07:23.38,00:07:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No, sir. Captain, I don't want to 
take up any...
Dialogue: 0,00:07:25.41,00:07:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, if you'll just follow the 
rest of the crew to the grav tanks,
Dialogue: 0,00:07:28.28,00:07:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,we're almost underway.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:29.58,00:07:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That bunk better be 
squared away, Mr. Cooper,
Dialogue: 0,00:07:31.55,00:07:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,or you'll find yourself 
walking to Neptune.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:33.42,00:07:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the hold—up, Peters?
Dialogue: 0,00:07:34.75,00:07:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just loading the last of 
the co2 scrubbers, sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:37.79,00:07:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You stand right here.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:42.56,00:07:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Smith: Thanks, d.J.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:44.13,00:07:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Smith: Hats off in the tank. 
Sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:45.63,00:07:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,First time in a grav couch?
Dialogue: 0,00:07:47.47,00:07:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:50.10,00:07:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I think your captain has some kind of 
a problem with me.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:53.61,00:07:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well. Don't worry about him.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:55.67,00:07:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He just loves having complete 
strangers on his ship.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:58.41,00:08:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,D.j. D.J.: Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:02.61,00:08:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:03.82,00:08:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this necessary?
Dialogue: 0,00:08:05.75,00:08:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,When the ion drive fires,
Dialogue: 0,00:08:07.62,00:08:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be taking about 30 g's.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:10.42,00:08:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a tank,
Dialogue: 0,00:08:11.86,00:08:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the force would 
quuefy your skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:15.69,00:08:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen the effect on mice.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:21.83,00:08:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Claustrophobic?
Dialogue: 0,00:08:23.87,00:08:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Very. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:49.83,00:08:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Claire: Billy.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:34.07,00:09:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so alone.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:39.84,00:09:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,00:09:50.22,00:09:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,00:10:01.97,00:10:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:35.93,00:10:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Claire: Billy?
Dialogue: 0,00:10:39.60,00:10:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so cold.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:51.02,00:10:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Claire.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:55.19,00:10:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:08.97,00:11:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all right. Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:11.17,00:11:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,D.j.i
Dialogue: 0,00:11:13.71,00:11:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,okay, Dr. Weir, let's get you up. 
Okay, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:15.47,00:11:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, take it easy. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:16.84,00:11:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:20.15,00:11:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now move nice and slow.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:21.45,00:11:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been in stasis 
for 56 days.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:23.62,00:11:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna experience a little 
disorientation, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:26.55,00:11:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all right now, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:27.99,00:11:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, take that. Don't rush it.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:30.62,00:11:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All yours.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:36.06,00:11:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, doc?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:38.70,00:11:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Want some coffee?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:40.57,00:11:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:42.33,00:11:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like some coffee?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:46.17,00:11:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:49.01,00:11:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:51.51,00:11:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you, starck?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:53.21,00:11:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like something 
hot and black inside you?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:55.68,00:11:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh! Is that an offer?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:57.05,00:11:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:58.48,00:12:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about 
some coffee, then?
Dialogue: 0,00:12:00.15,00:12:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck? Oh.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:01.85,00:12:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Why aren't you on the 
bndge?
Dialogue: 0,00:12:04.16,00:12:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mind 
if I get dressed first?
Dialogue: 0,00:12:05.52,00:12:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, lieutenant,
Dialogue: 0,00:12:06.59,00:12:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I do mind if you 
get dressed first.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:08.23,00:12:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, people. 
We have a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:11.16,00:12:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Peters: Okay, Denny, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:13.36,00:12:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:14.87,00:12:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Play horsey, mommy. Play horsey.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:16.87,00:12:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, no more ball in the house.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:19.20,00:12:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Cooper: Sorry, mama.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:20.61,00:12:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin: Yeah, you're the one who 
can't catch.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:22.34,00:12:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Cooper: Yo, apologize.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:23.44,00:12:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, mama bean
Dialogue: 0,00:12:26.61,00:12:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,all right. All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:27.71,00:12:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Uh, Peters. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:30.62,00:12:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I did try to find 
a replacement for you,
Dialogue: 0,00:12:32.88,00:12:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but with such short notice, 
it was impossible.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:35.89,00:12:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:37.46,00:12:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I talked to my ex.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:39.26,00:12:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to take 
Denny for Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:41.29,00:12:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get him for the summer,
Dialogue: 0,00:12:44.56,00:12:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,so everything's all right.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:46.53,00:12:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Cooper: Smitty.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:48.47,00:12:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,00:12:50.14,00:12:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,in approximately 
two hours and 23 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,00:12:52.14,00:12:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll be arriving in 
the orbit of Neptune.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:54.54,00:12:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much. 
I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:55.91,00:12:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:57.74,00:13:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All boards are green. 
Everything's five by five.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:00.38,00:13:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Usac been notified 
of our position?
Dialogue: 0,00:13:01.95,00:13:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck: Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:03.21,00:13:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, people, listen up. Smith: 
D.J.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:04.98,00:13:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: As you all know, we have an 
addition to our crew.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:07.15,00:13:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Weir, you care to join us?
Dialogue: 0,00:13:10.26,00:13:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Introductions all around.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:11.76,00:13:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my xo, 
lieutenant starck.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:13.83,00:13:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Justin, engineering.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:15.63,00:13:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The funky spaceman 
over here is Mr. Cooper.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:17.43,00:13:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly is it you do 
on board this ship, Coop?
Dialogue: 0,00:13:19.63,00:13:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, doc, 
I'm your best friend, okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:13:22.30,00:13:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the lifesaver 
and the heartbreaker.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:24.64,00:13:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a rescue technician.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:26.77,00:13:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Peters, 
medical technician.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:28.64,00:13:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And my pilot, Mr. Smith.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:32.24,00:13:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The gloomy Gus in the corner over 
there, that's...
Dialogue: 0,00:13:34.51,00:13:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,D.j. Trauma.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:39.02,00:13:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Cooper: All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:40.75,00:13:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we all know each other,
Dialogue: 0,00:13:42.19,00:13:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,skipper, I got a question. 
Miller: Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:43.82,00:13:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What the fuck are we doing 
way out here?
Dialogue: 0,00:13:45.86,00:13:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, perhaps the good doctor will be 
kind enough to tell us.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:49.69,00:13:51.100,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,00:13:52.10,00:13:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,First of all, I want to say how much 
I appreciate
Dialogue: 0,00:13:53.83,00:13:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,this opportunity 
to join you on what I...
Dialogue: 0,00:13:55.60,00:13:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for sure that you appreciate 
being here, doctor,
Dialogue: 0,00:13:57.54,00:13:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but you must understand 
that we don't.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:59.94,00:14:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We were taken off 
a well-deserved leave
Dialogue: 0,00:14:01.64,00:14:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and sent into Neptune space.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:03.44,00:14:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We are now three billion klicks from 
the nearest outpost.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:07.38,00:14:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The last time usac 
attempted a rescue
Dialogue: 0,00:14:09.21,00:14:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,this far past the outer reach,
Dialogue: 0,00:14:10.65,00:14:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,well, we lost both ships. 
80, if you please...
Dialogue: 0,00:14:14.52,00:14:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Well...
Dialogue: 0,00:14:17.29,00:14:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything I'm about to tell you is 
considered code black by the NSA.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:21.19,00:14:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Usac intercepted 
a radio transmission
Dialogue: 0,00:14:23.73,00:14:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,from a decaying orbit 
around Neptune.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:27.23,00:14:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The source of this transmission has 
beenidenfified
Dialogue: 0,00:14:30.97,00:14:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,as the event horizon.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:35.04,00:14:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, that's bullshit, for 
starters.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:37.41,00:14:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Skipper, 
you took me off leave...
Dialogue: 0,00:14:38.74,00:14:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:40.35,00:14:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Smitty, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:43.92,00:14:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cooper, as you were.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:47.22,00:14:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the man speak.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:48.72,00:14:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Weir: What was made public about the 
event horizon,
Dialogue: 0,00:14:50.82,00:14:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,that she was a deep space 
research vessel,
Dialogue: 0,00:14:53.26,00:14:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,that her reactor went critical,
Dialogue: 0,00:14:55.83,00:14:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and that the ship blew up,
Dialogue: 0,00:14:57.40,00:14:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,none of that is true.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:58.90,00:15:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The event horizon 
was the culmination
Dialogue: 0,00:15:01.00,00:15:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,of a secret government project to 
create a spacecraft
Dialogue: 0,00:15:03.70,00:15:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,capable of 
faster-than-light flight.
Dialogue: 0,00:15:06.00,00:15:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Smith: I don't... excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,00:15:07.67,00:15:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,See, you can't actually do that.
Dialogue: 0,00:15:09.71,00:15:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The law of relativity prohibits 
faster-than-light travel.
Dialogue: 0,00:15:13.78,00:15:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Relativity, yes. We can't break the 
law of relativity.
Dialogue: 0,00:15:18.25,00:15:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We can go around it.
Dialogue: 0,00:15:20.22,00:15:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship doesn't really 
go faster than light.
Dialogue: 0,00:15:21.75,00:15:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What it does is it creates 
a dimensional gateway,
Dialogue: 0,00:15:25.02,00:15:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,that allows it to 
jump instantaneously
Dialogue: 0,00:15:27.19,00:15:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,from one point of the universe to 
another light years away.
Dialogue: 0,00:15:29.59,00:15:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,00:15:31.36,00:15:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's... it's difficult to... 
It's all math.
Dialogue: 0,00:15:34.03,00:15:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Try us, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,00:15:36.37,00:15:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, well, uh, 
using layman's terms,
Dialogue: 0,00:15:39.47,00:15:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,we use a rotating magnetic field
Dialogue: 0,00:15:41.77,00:15:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to focus a narrow beam 
of gravitons.
Dialogue: 0,00:15:43.54,00:15:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,These in turn fold space-time
Dialogue: 0,00:15:46.11,00:15:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,consistent with 
weyl tensor dynamics,
Dialogue: 0,00:15:48.38,00:15:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,until the space—time curvature 
becomes infinitely large
Dialogue: 0,00:15:51.22,00:15:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and you produce a singularity. Now, 
the singularity...
Dialogue: 0,00:15:53.89,00:15:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Layman's terms.
Dialogue: 0,00:15:55.32,00:15:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, fuck layman's terms. 
Do you speak English?
Dialogue: 0,00:15:59.26,00:16:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,00:16:02.83,00:16:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine, for a minute, 
that this piece of paper...
Dialogue: 0,00:16:06.06,00:16:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Uh, that's Vanessa, and 
that's mine. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,00:16:09.40,00:16:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Attractive piece of paper 
represents space-time,
Dialogue: 0,00:16:12.30,00:16:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and you want to get 
from point "a" here...
Dialogue: 0,00:16:15.01,00:16:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,00:16:16.41,00:16:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,To point "b" there.
Dialogue: 0,00:16:18.51,00:16:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what's the shortest distance 
between two points?
Dialogue: 0,00:16:21.41,00:16:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A straight line.
Dialogue: 0,00:16:24.02,00:16:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,00:16:25.42,00:16:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The shortest distance 
between two points is zero.
Dialogue: 0,00:16:27.82,00:16:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's what 
the gateway does.
Dialogue: 0,00:16:30.32,00:16:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It folds space,
Dialogue: 0,00:16:33.69,00:16:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,so that point "a" and point "b" 
co-exist in the same space and time.
Dialogue: 0,00:16:39.30,00:16:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,When the spacecraft 
passes through the gateway,
Dialogue: 0,00:16:43.47,00:16:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,space returns to normal.
Dialogue: 0,00:16:45.97,00:16:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called a gravity drive.
Dialogue: 0,00:16:49.31,00:16:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin: 
How do you know all this?
Dialogue: 0,00:16:51.64,00:16:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I built it.
Dialogue: 0,00:16:53.64,00:16:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can see 
why they sent you.
Dialogue: 0,00:16:55.68,00:16:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So if the ship didn't blow up, then 
what happened?
Dialogue: 0,00:16:58.55,00:17:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the mission was going 
perfectly, like a textbook.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:02.65,00:17:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They reached safe distance 
using conventional thrusters.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:05.29,00:17:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All systems looked good.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:07.23,00:17:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They had the go—ahead 
to use the gravity drive
Dialogue: 0,00:17:09.29,00:17:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,to open the gateway 
to proxima centauri,
Dialogue: 0,00:17:12.56,00:17:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and then, they just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:15.33,00:17:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Vanished without a trace, 
until now.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:19.47,00:17:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's she been for the last seven 
years, doctor?
Dialogue: 0,00:17:22.84,00:17:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what we're here 
to find out.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:25.64,00:17:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, we've been unable 
to verify live contact,
Dialogue: 0,00:17:29.75,00:17:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but tdrs did receive 
this single transmission.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:44.26,00:17:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What the fucking hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,00:17:45.56,00:17:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:47.03,00:17:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Houston passed the same recording 
through several filters,
Dialogue: 0,00:17:50.23,00:17:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,managed to isolate what appears to be 
a human voice.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:02.58,00:18:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not even sure 
if it qualifies as language.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:04.72,00:18:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Latin. What?
Dialogue: 0,00:18:07.55,00:18:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I think 
it sounds like Latin.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:10.12,00:18:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you translate it?
Dialogue: 0,00:18:11.39,00:18:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Play it again.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:17.13,00:18:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Right there. You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,00:18:22.57,00:18:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like, "liberate me,"
Dialogue: 0,00:18:26.44,00:18:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,something. I don't know. 
I can't make out the rest.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:28.14,00:18:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,"Liberate me?"
Dialogue: 0,00:18:31.08,00:18:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,"Save me."
Dialogue: 0,00:18:34.65,00:18:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: All right. 
Stations, people.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:50.46,00:18:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Crossing the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:52.23,00:18:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Optimum approach angle 
is 14 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:54.80,00:18:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Come around to 334.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:56.90,00:18:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Heading 334, sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:58.30,00:19:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your approach vector negative, 
14 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:01.41,00:19:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,1-4 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:06.34,00:19:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a lock on event horizon's 
navigation beacon.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:10.35,00:19:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She's in the upper ionosphere and it 
looks like...
Dialogue: 0,00:19:12.52,00:19:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in for some very 
heavy chop, sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:18.99,00:19:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring us in nice and tight, Mr. 
Smith. Sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:21.76,00:19:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Justin, how's my ship?
Dialogue: 0,00:19:23.53,00:19:24.100,Default,,0,0,0,,Smooth sailing, sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:26.10,00:19:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Matching speed on my Mark.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:28.00,00:19:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, two, one. Mark.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:36.04,00:19:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Range?
Dialogue: 0,00:19:37.14,00:19:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,10,000 meters and closing, sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:39.61,00:19:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Starck. 
Starck: Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:40.85,00:19:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on the horn. 
See if anybody is listening.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:42.78,00:19:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the us. Aerospace command 
vessel Lewis & Clark
Dialogue: 0,00:19:45.72,00:19:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,hailing event horizon.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:47.19,00:19:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Event horizon, do you read?
Dialogue: 0,00:19:48.95,00:19:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Dr. Weir.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:51.49,00:19:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you'll want to see this.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:53.66,00:19:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,00:19:54.96,00:19:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead ahead. 5,000 meters!
Dialogue: 0,00:19:56.89,00:19:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck? Anybody home?
Dialogue: 0,00:19:58.23,00:19:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Event horizon, do you read?
Dialogue: 0,00:19:59.96,00:20:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,3,000 meters and closing!
Dialogue: 0,00:20:06.54,00:20:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see a thing.
Dialogue: 0,00:20:07.81,00:20:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,1,500 meters, sir. 
We're getting too close.
Dialogue: 0,00:20:10.34,00:20:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,00:20:11.58,00:20:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The scope is lit. 
It's right in front of us.
Dialogue: 0,00:20:13.71,00:20:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,1,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,00:20:15.18,00:20:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Proximity warning!
Dialogue: 0,00:20:16.65,00:20:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,900, 800, 700.
Dialogue: 0,00:20:20.32,00:20:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We're right on top of her, sir! 
Miller: We're gonna hit.
Dialogue: 0,00:20:22.85,00:20:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck! It's right there! God!
Dialogue: 0,00:20:27.56,00:20:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Reverse thrusters. Full!
Dialogue: 0,00:20:42.91,00:20:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There she is.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:04.73,00:21:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin: Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:06.30,00:21:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Very impressive ship, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:09.53,00:21:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:10.74,00:21:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Smith, 
are you up for a flyby?
Dialogue: 0,00:21:14.04,00:21:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Yes, I'd love to.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:30.49,00:21:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the main airlock, 
we can dock in there.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:33.12,00:21:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Smith.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:35.06,00:21:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Use the arm and lock us onto that 
small antenna cluster.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:46.10,00:21:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We should go 
very carefully here.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:47.31,00:21:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That is not 
a load-bearing structure.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:51.51,00:21:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Is now, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:56.45,00:21:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything five by five?
Dialogue: 0,00:21:58.12,00:21:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Locked in to the event horizon.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:59.78,00:22:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, smitty. 
Light 'em if you got 'em.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:01.99,00:22:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:05.42,00:22:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck, give me a read.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:07.19,00:22:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The reactor's still hot.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:08.86,00:22:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, we've got several small radiation 
sources but no leaks.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:11.46,00:22:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably it's nothing serious.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:12.96,00:22:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Do they have pressure? 
Affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:14.50,00:22:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The hull's intact, uh, 
but there's no gravity,
Dialogue: 0,00:22:17.13,00:22:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and the thermal units 
are off-line.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:19.50,00:22:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm showing deep cold.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:21.31,00:22:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The crew couldn't survive 
unless they were in stasis.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:23.61,00:22:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Find 'em, starck.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:25.21,00:22:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm already on it, captain. 
Bio-scan is on the line.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:30.95,00:22:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something 
wrong with the scan.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:32.48,00:22:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it radiation interference?
Dialogue: 0,00:22:34.05,00:22:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck: There's not enough 
to throw it off.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:35.65,00:22:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm picking up trace life forms,
Dialogue: 0,00:22:37.49,00:22:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't get 
a lock on their location.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:39.82,00:22:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,These readings are all over the ship. 
It doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:42.23,00:22:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we do it the hard way. 
Deck by deck, room by room.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:45.86,00:22:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck, deploy the umbilicus.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:47.80,00:22:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Smitty, fire up the boards 
in the war room.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:49.73,00:22:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:51.24,00:22:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Justin, I believe 
you're up for a walk?
Dialogue: 0,00:22:53.80,00:22:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:59.24,00:23:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, I'm gonna need you 
here on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:01.18,00:23:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, I didn't come out all this 
way just to sit on your bridge.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:05.32,00:23:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to be on that ship.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:06.68,00:23:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we've secured the ship, 
we'll bring you on board.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:08.65,00:23:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry, that's unacceptable. I 
need to be on that ship.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:10.49,00:23:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we've secured the ship. 
That's the way it is.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:13.52,00:23:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to guide us 
from the com station.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:15.23,00:23:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where I need you.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:16.69,00:23:17.100,Default,,0,0,0,,Help us do ourjob.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:31.34,00:23:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh! Honey, honey, 
you forgot your briefcase.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:46.12,00:23:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand clear.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:49.69,00:23:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything gets funky, Cooper...
Dialogue: 0,00:23:51.76,00:23:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be on it.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:54.93,00:23:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, baby bear, 
keep your nose clean.
Dialogue: 0,00:24:05.54,00:24:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,D.j., showtime.
Dialogue: 0,00:24:09.48,00:24:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Video feed is clear.
Dialogue: 0,00:24:11.32,00:24:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you with us, Dr. Weir?
Dialogue: 0,00:24:13.28,00:24:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm... I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,00:24:15.89,00:24:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: We are crossing the 
umbilicus,
Dialogue: 0,00:24:17.72,00:24:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,making our approach 
to the event horizon.
Dialogue: 0,00:24:22.83,00:24:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're at the outer 
airlock door.
Dialogue: 0,00:24:26.93,00:24:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Magnetic boots on.
Dialogue: 0,00:24:34.34,00:24:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Peters: We've got pressure.
Dialogue: 0,00:24:55.63,00:24:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Place is a deep freeze.
Dialogue: 0,00:24:59.100,00:25:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We got ice crystals everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:03.70,00:25:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the central corridor 
that you're in now.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:06.10,00:25:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It connects the personnel areas at 
the front of the ship
Dialogue: 0,00:25:08.77,00:25:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,to engineering at the rear.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:12.64,00:25:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Mr. Justin, 
you take engineering.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:14.28,00:25:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin: Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:15.55,00:25:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Peters and I'll take 
the forward decks.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:28.33,00:25:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Doctor, what are these?
Dialogue: 0,00:25:31.23,00:25:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Peters: Yeah, I've got 
another one over here.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:33.23,00:25:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They are all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:34.80,00:25:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,In an emergency,
Dialogue: 0,00:25:36.47,00:25:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,they destroy the central corridor and 
split the ship in half,
Dialogue: 0,00:25:40.67,00:25:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and then the crew can use 
the foredecks as a lifeboat.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:49.25,00:25:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: I'm in medical. 
No casualties.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:56.92,00:25:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Place looks like 
it's never been used.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:59.22,00:26:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Weir: You still haven't 
seen any crew?
Dialogue: 0,00:26:00.69,00:26:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If we saw any crew, doctor, 
you'd know it by now.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:04.100,00:26:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Scanning for life readings.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:10.60,00:26:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is a tomb.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:15.44,00:26:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Fuck me!
Dialogue: 0,00:26:18.04,00:26:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck: 
Miller. Miller, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:26:19.91,00:26:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like skipper 
got a case of the willies.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:23.05,00:26:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck: Cooper, 
get back to your post.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:25.08,00:26:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller, your heart rate 
just went through the roof.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:27.55,00:26:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:35.39,00:26:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin: I think 
I've reached the door
Dialogue: 0,00:26:36.59,00:26:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,to the first containment, 
Dr. Weir.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:39.43,00:26:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Weir: The engineering decks are on 
the other side.
Dialogue: 0,00:26:41.57,00:26:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin: Kay, let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:00.99,00:27:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell 
is this place, Dr. Weir?
Dialogue: 0,00:27:04.62,00:27:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It allows you to enter 
the second containment
Dialogue: 0,00:27:06.42,00:27:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,without compromising 
the magnetic fields.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:10.76,00:27:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a meat grinder to me.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:17.33,00:27:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Peters: I'm on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:26.84,00:27:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Got some blood here.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:42.79,00:27:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin: There must have been 
a coolant leak.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:44.76,00:27:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this shit is everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:48.97,00:27:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Coolant level's on reserve, but well 
within the safety line.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:04.55,00:28:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Peters, 
could you turn back and left?
Dialogue: 0,00:28:08.82,00:28:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck: What is it?
Dialogue: 0,00:28:10.39,00:28:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ship's log.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:31.41,00:28:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Peters: It's stuck.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:34.91,00:28:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty jammed in there.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:42.49,00:28:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck: Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:46.06,00:28:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell 
happened to his eyes?
Dialogue: 0,00:28:48.53,00:28:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Explosive decompression.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:50.53,00:28:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Decompression doesn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:54.03,00:28:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,D.j.: Looks like it was caused by...
Dialogue: 0,00:28:56.07,00:28:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, 
an animal or something.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:57.77,00:29:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the damage to the soft 
tissue, massive abrasions.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:02.17,00:29:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Corpse-sicle.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:06.18,00:29:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin: I'm scanning for 
life forms.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:13.62,00:29:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm getting some really strange 
readings in here.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:29.23,00:29:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see if I can 
get some power up.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:42.91,00:29:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the core, 
the gravity drive.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:51.09,00:29:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The heart of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:08.64,00:30:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Jusfin.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:10.27,00:30:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin, you're breaking up.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:22.92,00:30:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin, come in.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:36.13,00:30:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:37.50,00:30:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The life scan just 
went off the scale.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:50.61,00:30:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong, starck. 
Pull him out. Pull him out.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:58.99,00:31:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,00:31:04.96,00:31:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:06.16,00:31:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Coop. I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:46.90,00:31:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: 
Boarding party, sound off.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:49.27,00:31:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Miller. 
Can anybody hear me?
Dialogue: 0,00:31:58.58,00:32:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What the fuck was that?
Dialogue: 0,00:32:00.28,00:32:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Pressure emergency! We've lost the 
starboard baffle.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:03.35,00:32:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The hull's been breached!
Dialogue: 0,00:32:06.19,00:32:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll contain it here for as long as I 
can! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,00:32:08.63,00:32:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're losing atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:12.56,00:32:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There are pressure suits 
in the airlock. Go!
Dialogue: 0,00:32:15.07,00:32:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Cooper: 
Here I come. Here I come.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:21.44,00:32:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, baby bear.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:23.57,00:32:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm almost there, almost there.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:30.38,00:32:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you. I got...
Dialogue: 0,00:32:33.25,00:32:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out. Watch...
Dialogue: 0,00:32:36.42,00:32:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you. 
What the fuck is this?
Dialogue: 0,00:32:39.46,00:32:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:43.89,00:32:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Miller. Captain Miller, do 
you copy? Over.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:47.30,00:32:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Smitty, 
where you been all my life?
Dialogue: 0,00:32:49.00,00:32:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a major 
situation here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:51.07,00:32:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We've lost the starboard baffle, and 
the hull's been breached.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:53.97,00:32:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, the safety circuits, 
they have failed.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:56.91,00:32:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we have time for a weld? 
No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:59.24,00:33:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got 218 liters of gas left, 
sir, and then we've got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:03.31,00:33:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The oxygen tanks, they failed, 
they're broken.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:05.98,00:33:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, we are fucking dead!
Dialogue: 0,00:33:07.82,00:33:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the event horizon?
Dialogue: 0,00:33:09.75,00:33:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,00:33:11.15,00:33:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got air and power.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:12.96,00:33:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our only chance.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:14.16,00:33:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way 
I'm getting on that bastard.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:16.29,00:33:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't even know 
what happened on that ship.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:17.96,00:33:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It beats dying, Mr. Smith.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:20.30,00:33:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I want all personnel on board 
the event horizon, pronto.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:24.30,00:33:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet at the air tanks.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:26.00,00:33:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ahead of you, sir. Bringing all 
thermal units online.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:30.14,00:33:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold tight. Prep for g's.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:33.48,00:33:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Gravity in five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:50.39,00:33:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Cooper: Wake up, open your eyes. All 
right?
Dialogue: 0,00:33:52.36,00:33:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:17.99,00:34:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Weir.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:20.76,00:34:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,00:34:22.76,00:34:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought most 
primary systems online
Dialogue: 0,00:34:25.86,00:34:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,for now. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:27.20,00:34:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck, what's our status?
Dialogue: 0,00:34:28.90,00:34:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The antenna array 
is completely fried.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:31.07,00:34:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got no radio, 
no laser, no high gain.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:34.37,00:34:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's coming to help us.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:36.61,00:34:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This air tastes bad. 
Yeah, carbon dioxide, I know.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:39.21,00:34:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's building up 
with every breath we take.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:41.68,00:34:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And the co2 filters 
on the event horizon are shot.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:44.38,00:34:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we take the scrubbers from the 
Clark. That gives us what?
Dialogue: 0,00:34:46.75,00:34:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough breathable 
air for 20 hours,
Dialogue: 0,00:34:48.92,00:34:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but after that, we'd better be on our 
way home.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:07.60,00:35:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Smith: I'm on the port side of the 
hull,
Dialogue: 0,00:35:09.07,00:35:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,approaching 
the dorsal heat sink.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:15.28,00:35:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:22.72,00:35:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Miller. Captain Miller, do 
you copy? Over.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:25.32,00:35:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I copy, Mr. Smith. 
How's my ship?
Dialogue: 0,00:35:27.89,00:35:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, we've got a seven—meter fracture 
on the outer hull.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:30.89,00:35:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be able to repair her,
Dialogue: 0,00:35:32.26,00:35:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's gonna take 
an awful lot of time, sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:33.83,00:35:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Negative. 
20 hours, we run out of air.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:36.47,00:35:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood, sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:40.84,00:35:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened here, doctor?
Dialogue: 0,00:35:54.02,00:35:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, how is he?
Dialogue: 0,00:35:57.02,00:36:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,His vital signs seem stable, but he's 
unresponsive to stimuli.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:01.99,00:36:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:07.53,00:36:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He might wake up in 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:11.64,00:36:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He might not wake up at all.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:14.14,00:36:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, skipper, I know 
this shit sounds weird,
Dialogue: 0,00:36:15.97,00:36:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but, I mean, 
there was like nothing,
Dialogue: 0,00:36:18.04,00:36:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and then Justin appeared 
and_.And...
Dialogue: 0,00:36:21.85,00:36:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It was liquid, and the whole core 
just turned solid.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:25.32,00:36:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just not 
physically possible.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:27.35,00:36:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, please. Please, don't start 
in with that physics shit.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:30.15,00:36:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:32.16,00:36:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Cooper, it would mean 
the gateway was open.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:34.96,00:36:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it. The gateway was open.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:37.06,00:36:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The gateway couldn't be open
Dialogue: 0,00:36:38.73,00:36:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,because the gravity drive 
wasn't activated.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:41.03,00:36:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm telling you 
what I saw, doc! 80...
Dialogue: 0,00:36:43.17,00:36:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't just start 
up by itself.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:44.87,00:36:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Cooper, you are out of line.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:48.67,00:36:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, Mr. Justin may die. 
Now, I have to assume
Dialogue: 0,00:36:51.88,00:36:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,that whatever happened to him 
could happen to all of us.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:55.38,00:36:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Cooper says 
he saw something.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:57.81,00:36:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe he saw something.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:01.08,00:37:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I need an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:06.76,00:37:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,In my view, 
Mr. Cooper's delusional,
Dialogue: 0,00:37:09.19,00:37:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,if you don't mind my saying so.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:11.09,00:37:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But maybe he saw
Dialogue: 0,00:37:13.20,00:37:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,an optical effect caused 
by gravitational distortion.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:16.53,00:37:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,"An optical effect"? 
That's fucking poetic.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:18.40,00:37:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the fuck... Cooper!
Dialogue: 0,00:37:20.74,00:37:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. All right.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:24.77,00:37:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Gravitational distortion.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:26.34,00:37:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What could create that, doctor?
Dialogue: 0,00:37:28.01,00:37:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If, somehow, a burst of gravity waves 
escaped from the core,
Dialogue: 0,00:37:33.52,00:37:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,it could distort space-time.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:35.29,00:37:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It could make Justin 
seem to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:37.35,00:37:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It could also have damaged 
the Lewis & Clark.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:41.93,00:37:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I think 
this is entirely unlikely.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:44.13,00:37:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's in the core, doctor?
Dialogue: 0,00:37:47.56,00:37:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:48.87,00:37:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how much time 
do you need? We have
Dialogue: 0,00:37:51.74,00:37:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,17 hours and 48 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:55.44,00:37:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What's in the core?
Dialogue: 0,00:37:59.24,00:38:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Weir: This is the gateway.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:01.81,00:38:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, these three magnetic rings,
Dialogue: 0,00:38:03.98,00:38:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,when they align, it creates 
an artificial black hole
Dialogue: 0,00:38:07.15,00:38:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,which allows the ship to travel to 
any point in space.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:09.92,00:38:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A black hole, the most destructive 
force in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:14.06,00:38:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And you've created one?
Dialogue: 0,00:38:15.46,00:38:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely, yes. Because we can
Dialogue: 0,00:38:18.13,00:38:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,use that immense power 
to bend space-time.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:21.97,00:38:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it would take the Lewis & Clark 
1,000 years
Dialogue: 0,00:38:25.67,00:38:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,to reach our nearest star.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:28.07,00:38:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But event horizon 
could be there in a day.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:29.94,00:38:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If it worked.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:31.61,00:38:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You can come down. 
It's perfectly safe.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:39.32,00:38:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: So, if Mr. Justin was 
sucked through your gateway,
Dialogue: 0,00:38:42.42,00:38:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,he could've gone wherever 
the event horizon's been.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:44.99,00:38:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Weir: Theoretically, yes. 
But as I told you before,
Dialogue: 0,00:38:47.52,00:38:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,the gateway can't 
just open by itself.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:50.36,00:38:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: I see.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:51.63,00:38:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant, I want this room sealed 
off.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:53.30,00:38:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Second containment from here on in is 
off-limits.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:55.27,00:38:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck: Yes, sir. 
Captain, there's no danger.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:57.93,00:39:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The gateway's contained 
behind three magnetic fields.
Dialogue: 0,00:39:00.04,00:39:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's perfectly safe. Safe?
Dialogue: 0,00:39:02.51,00:39:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, my ship is in pieces
Dialogue: 0,00:39:04.14,00:39:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and one of my crewmen 
may not make it home alive.
Dialogue: 0,00:39:06.98,00:39:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else 
goes near this thing.
Dialogue: 0,00:39:30.03,00:39:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Peters: Come on.
Dialogue: 0,00:39:33.30,00:39:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There's got to be 
something on this log.
Dialogue: 0,00:39:37.54,00:39:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,00:39:43.01,00:39:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,D.j.?
Dialogue: 0,00:40:04.40,00:40:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,D.j., where are you?
Dialogue: 0,00:40:06.17,00:40:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,D.j.: I'm up on deck four.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:01.72,00:41:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:15.77,00:41:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Peters!
Dialogue: 0,00:41:23.48,00:41:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? You all right?
Dialogue: 0,00:41:42.63,00:41:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up? 
You was out there so long,
Dialogue: 0,00:41:44.97,00:41:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were 
trying to break my record.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:46.80,00:41:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I'd rather spend 
the next 12 hours outside,
Dialogue: 0,00:41:50.17,00:41:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,than another five seconds 
in this shit can.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:52.61,00:41:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the final entry 
in the ship's log.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:55.45,00:41:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kilpack: I want to say 
how proud I am of my crew.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:58.15,00:42:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to name 
my station heads,
Dialogue: 0,00:42:00.68,00:42:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Chris chambers, Janice Reuben,
Dialogue: 0,00:42:03.45,00:42:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ben Fender, dick Smith.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:08.12,00:42:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We've reached safe distance...
Dialogue: 0,00:42:09.63,00:42:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is John kilpack, 
ship's captain.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:11.39,00:42:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're preparing to 
engage the gravity drive,
Dialogue: 0,00:42:14.96,00:42:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and open the gateway 
to proxima centauri.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:21.54,00:42:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail and farewell.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:31.41,00:42:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that? I'll run it through a 
few filters,
Dialogue: 0,00:42:33.68,00:42:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,see if I can clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:39.82,00:42:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a power drain.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:40.92,00:42:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the core.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:43.89,00:42:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Stay here. 
Look after Justin.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:45.73,00:42:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want anybody else 
near that thing.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:47.60,00:42:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:50.53,00:42:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: 
What's causing the drain?
Dialogue: 0,00:42:52.24,00:42:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Weir: 
Magnetic fields are holding.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:54.40,00:42:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe a short in the fail—safe 
circuit. I'll check it.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:57.57,00:42:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you give us a hand?
Dialogue: 0,00:43:20.13,00:43:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Jusfin.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:21.90,00:43:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,00:43:24.57,00:43:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:26.04,00:43:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's coming?
Dialogue: 0,00:43:28.61,00:43:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The dark.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:47.66,00:43:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yeah, that's the one.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:03.07,00:44:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Claire: Billy.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:15.59,00:44:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Billy.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:32.10,00:44:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Billy.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:44.28,00:44:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller!
Dialogue: 0,00:44:46.52,00:44:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Miller!
Dialogue: 0,00:44:48.45,00:44:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got some problems here.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:56.06,00:44:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Be with me
Dialogue: 0,00:44:58.33,00:44:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,forever.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:08.20,00:45:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Weir?
Dialogue: 0,00:45:36.27,00:45:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Carbon dioxide can produce 
hallucinations, impairjudgment.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:39.24,00:45:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,God damn it, d.J., 
it was not a hallucination.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:41.60,00:45:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:42.91,00:45:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, you were in the duct.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:45.41,00:45:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have heard something.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:49.05,00:45:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have seen something.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:50.41,00:45:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:51.91,00:45:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,About an hour ago, I saw my son
Dialogue: 0,00:45:54.58,00:45:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,lying on the examination table.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:57.89,00:45:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,00:46:00.52,00:46:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And his legs were crawling...
Dialogue: 0,00:46:01.89,00:46:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Peters, if you 
don't mind my saying so,
Dialogue: 0,00:46:03.56,00:46:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,itsounds a little like shock.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:04.96,00:46:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that 
you're traumatized...
Dialogue: 0,00:46:06.43,00:46:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No. No... by seeing the body on 
the...
Dialogue: 0,00:46:07.53,00:46:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. No!
Dialogue: 0,00:46:11.60,00:46:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen bodies before. 
This was different.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:14.10,00:46:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right. 
Now, this... this was real.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:15.97,00:46:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt... I felt heat.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:18.78,00:46:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not something 
that's in our heads.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:23.58,00:46:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Smitty, have you seen anything 
unusualatah?
Dialogue: 0,00:46:27.32,00:46:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I haven't seen anything, and I 
don't need to see anything, sir,
Dialogue: 0,00:46:29.75,00:46:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can tell you,
Dialogue: 0,00:46:32.29,00:46:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,this ship is fucked.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:34.49,00:46:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for that scientific 
analysis, Mr. Smith.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:37.06,00:46:38.100,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you don't need a fucking 
scientist to figure it out, do you?
Dialogue: 0,00:46:38.100,00:46:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, doc.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:40.30,00:46:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,When you break 
all the laws of physics,
Dialogue: 0,00:46:41.60,00:46:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,do you seriously think 
there won't be a price?
Dialogue: 0,00:46:42.77,00:46:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You already killed 
the last fucking crew.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:44.67,00:46:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you want 
to kill us as well!
Dialogue: 0,00:46:46.30,00:46:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a fucking ship, all right? 
D.J.!
Dialogue: 0,00:46:48.81,00:46:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a ship, 
do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,00:46:50.47,00:46:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a big hunk of metal.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:51.97,00:46:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing odd going on.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:54.18,00:46:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,D.j.?
Dialogue: 0,00:46:58.95,00:47:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:00.15,00:47:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,D.j.?
Dialogue: 0,00:47:04.49,00:47:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You all right? Yeah, I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,00:47:07.62,00:47:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:09.13,00:47:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Smitty.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:10.66,00:47:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right. That's it. Fucking...
Dialogue: 0,00:47:12.100,00:47:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough! I want you calm, I 
want you cool! Now!
Dialogue: 0,00:47:18.50,00:47:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:19.60,00:47:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going back upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:21.50,00:47:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going outside 
on the Clark with Cooper
Dialogue: 0,00:47:23.34,00:47:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're going 
to repair the ship.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:24.64,00:47:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:26.11,00:47:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mistakes, nobody goes home. 
Understood?
Dialogue: 0,00:47:29.51,00:47:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. All right.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:32.01,00:47:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir. Get moving.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:40.86,00:47:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller. What is it, starck?
Dialogue: 0,00:47:42.69,00:47:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran the bio—scan 
with the DNA-rna filters.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:45.33,00:47:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The results were bio readings...
Dialogue: 0,00:47:46.80,00:47:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Of an indeterminate origin. 
Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:48.36,00:47:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have anything useful to 
tell me, lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,00:47:51.03,00:47:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a theory.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:52.97,00:47:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:54.20,00:47:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that there's 
a connection between
Dialogue: 0,00:47:56.04,00:47:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the readings and 
the hallucinations,
Dialogue: 0,00:47:57.81,00:48:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,like, like they're all part 
of a defensive reaction
Dialogue: 0,00:48:00.38,00:48:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,some sort of immune system.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:01.81,00:48:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time 
to listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:03.38,00:48:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to listen to me. 
To what?
Dialogue: 0,00:48:05.15,00:48:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saying that this ship 
is reacting to us
Dialogue: 0,00:48:06.98,00:48:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and the reactions 
are getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:08.52,00:48:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if the ship brought back 
something with it,
Dialogue: 0,00:48:10.19,00:48:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,a life force of some kind.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:11.89,00:48:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you telling me? 
That this ship is alive?
Dialogue: 0,00:48:14.72,00:48:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted an answer, and it's the 
only one I've got.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:17.59,00:48:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, what I want, lieutenant, is to 
survive the next 10 hours.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:05.88,00:49:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Peters: Justin?
Dialogue: 0,00:49:08.44,00:49:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Jusfin!
Dialogue: 0,00:49:13.42,00:49:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Jusfin!
Dialogue: 0,00:50:05.84,00:50:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that? 
Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,00:50:08.10,00:50:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thatsound. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,00:50:09.34,00:50:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard it. What did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,00:50:10.51,00:50:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? 
Peters, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:12.14,00:50:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's d.J., all right?
Dialogue: 0,00:50:14.01,00:50:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't hear anything. 
Neither of us heard anything.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:15.68,00:50:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So just calm down, all right? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:17.11,00:50:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your breath back.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:18.35,00:50:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:19.45,00:50:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:20.52,00:50:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I was...
Dialogue: 0,00:50:25.96,00:50:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Peters: Make it stop! 
Make it stop!
Dialogue: 0,00:50:30.13,00:50:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:33.13,00:50:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck, move it.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:37.53,00:50:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,00:50:38.87,00:50:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Weir, stop. Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,00:50:40.50,00:50:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck: What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,00:50:45.21,00:50:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,In our current environment, Dr. Weir, 
self-control is an asset.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:55.72,00:50:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,00:50:56.92,00:51:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, the fonlvard airlock.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:00.42,00:51:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller, Smith, Cooper, 
anyone in the airlock?
Dialogue: 0,00:51:03.06,00:51:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: 
That's a negative, starck.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:05.53,00:51:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Jusfin.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:09.37,00:51:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Peters: Justin. D.J.: Don't!
Dialogue: 0,00:51:10.90,00:51:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Peters: Justin, no!
Dialogue: 0,00:51:13.00,00:51:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin, no! 
Justin, open the door.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:17.34,00:51:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller, come in.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:18.71,00:51:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller, come in. 
We have an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:21.61,00:51:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on 
in there, starck?
Dialogue: 0,00:51:23.85,00:51:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin's in the airlock.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:25.18,00:51:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Say again.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:26.68,00:51:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin is in the airlock 
and he is not wearing a suit.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:29.09,00:51:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit. I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:30.72,00:51:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,As you were, sailor.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:31.85,00:51:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Skipper, you need me on this.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:33.09,00:51:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you right where you are.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:34.36,00:51:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He's engaged the override.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:36.29,00:51:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you shut it down?
Dialogue: 0,00:51:37.39,00:51:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:39.10,00:51:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming to him, starck.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:40.20,00:51:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin! Open this door, now!
Dialogue: 0,00:51:46.94,00:51:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Starck, give me status.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:48.57,00:51:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You better hurry. 
He's engaged the override
Dialogue: 0,00:51:50.21,00:51:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and we can't 
open the inner door.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:51.44,00:51:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,D.j.: I'll get the kit.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:52.58,00:51:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin, open the door!
Dialogue: 0,00:51:59.88,00:52:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin, open the door.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:02.75,00:52:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear it?
Dialogue: 0,00:52:04.32,00:52:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep him talking.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:05.42,00:52:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Yes, I heard it.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:07.46,00:52:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what it is?
Dialogue: 0,00:52:09.06,00:52:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It shows you things
Dialogue: 0,00:52:11.16,00:52:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,horrible things.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:13.26,00:52:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What does?
Dialogue: 0,00:52:14.33,00:52:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The dark inside me 
from the other place.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:18.60,00:52:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't go back there. I won't.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:20.84,00:52:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, baby bear. 
Come on, open the door.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:22.67,00:52:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,00:52:23.81,00:52:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think 
she can talk him down.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:25.14,00:52:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She'd better.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:26.51,00:52:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If he opens the airlock, 
he's going to turn inside out.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:27.81,00:52:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Peters: 
No. No, you stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:29.81,00:52:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck: Almost got it.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:30.95,00:52:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I've almost got it.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:32.01,00:52:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay with me, Justin.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:33.45,00:52:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, now. Open that door!
Dialogue: 0,00:52:35.12,00:52:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If you could see the things I've 
seen, you wouldn't try to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:38.65,00:52:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not you talking. 
That's not you talking.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:40.92,00:52:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it. 
That's it, right there.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:42.93,00:52:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the door. Go for that button. 
Come on.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:45.83,00:52:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:48.86,00:52:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,00:52:52.00,00:52:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, Justin just 
activated the door.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:54.44,00:52:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's on a 30-second delay.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:55.87,00:52:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Justin!
Dialogue: 0,00:53:01.68,00:53:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Computer voice: Stand by for 
decompression in 25 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:06.65,00:53:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,00:53:08.68,00:53:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin: Hey. 
Starck, get it fucking open!
Dialogue: 0,00:53:10.55,00:53:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, open the door. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:12.22,00:53:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The inner door won't open when the 
outside door's been triggered.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:14.19,00:53:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It would decompress 
the entire ship.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:16.13,00:53:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my god. 
Mama bear, open the door.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:19.80,00:53:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, please.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:21.73,00:53:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin: Captain!
Dialogue: 0,00:53:22.90,00:53:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Patch me through to him.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:24.30,00:53:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Miller, tell them 
to open the door.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:26.17,00:53:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't do that, Justin.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:28.00,00:53:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die in here.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:29.54,00:53:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:31.34,00:53:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to listen 
to me very carefully,
Dialogue: 0,00:53:33.01,00:53:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm gonna get 
you out of there.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:38.38,00:53:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:40.25,00:53:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's starting. My eyes.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:43.09,00:53:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think about them. 
Shut them.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:44.59,00:53:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shut them as 
tight as you can.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:47.06,00:53:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:48.32,00:53:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Tuck yourself into 
a crouch position.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:49.56,00:53:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Make yourself into a ball now.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:51.36,00:53:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin: 
I can't breathe. Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:54.86,00:53:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, god, it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:57.20,00:54:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to huff and puff and blow 
all the air out of your lungs.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:01.60,00:54:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me? All the air out of 
your lungs, Justin.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:06.24,00:54:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Do it, now!
Dialogue: 0,00:54:20.12,00:54:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, baby bear.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:23.43,00:54:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Got him. I got him. 
Standby, people.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:27.60,00:54:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Standby.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:31.07,00:54:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got pressure.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:32.70,00:54:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Peters: We're coming, Justin. We're 
coming.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:36.24,00:54:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to need 
five units here.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:38.77,00:54:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold his head still.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:40.44,00:54:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Peters: Okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:43.81,00:54:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me some more mysoline, now.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:45.81,00:54:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,One thing at a time, 
let's keep him breathing.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:48.38,00:54:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Peters: He's bleeding out. Pressure's 
still dropping. Start the drip, 15 cc.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:00.43,00:55:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've stopped the bleeding, 
stabilized him best I can.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:05.43,00:55:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't be pretty, 
but he should live,
Dialogue: 0,00:55:08.60,00:55:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,if we make it back. 
We'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:12.78,00:55:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck, what's our time like?
Dialogue: 0,00:55:15.11,00:55:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Co2 levels will become toxic in four 
hours.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:18.75,00:55:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:20.45,00:55:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Peters, we've got to find out what 
happened to the other crew
Dialogue: 0,00:55:22.75,00:55:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,before the same thing 
happens to us.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:25.69,00:55:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can work on 
the log on the bridge,
Dialogue: 0,00:55:27.92,00:55:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but I won't go back to medical.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:29.76,00:55:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:31.83,00:55:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:34.96,00:55:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin said something about
Dialogue: 0,00:55:38.53,00:55:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,"the dark inside me."
Dialogue: 0,00:55:41.64,00:55:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,00:55:43.81,00:55:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,00:55:47.64,00:55:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it means anything.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:54.38,00:55:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Don't you walk away 
from me, mister.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:58.89,00:56:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like some answers, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:00.66,00:56:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to know why one of my men 
tried to commit suicide
Dialogue: 0,00:56:03.29,00:56:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,by throwing himself 
out of an airlock.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:04.79,00:56:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to know 
what caused that noise.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:06.56,00:56:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, thermal changes 
in the hull
Dialogue: 0,00:56:09.20,00:56:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,could've caused the metal to expand 
and contract rapidly
Dialogue: 0,00:56:12.57,00:56:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,causing reverberations. 
This is possible.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:14.20,00:56:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullshit! You built 
this fucking ship.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:16.51,00:56:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You've given me 
nothing but bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:18.37,00:56:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want me to say?
Dialogue: 0,00:56:20.84,00:56:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You said the ship's drive creates a 
gateway.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:24.75,00:56:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. To what?
Dialogue: 0,00:56:27.75,00:56:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,00:56:29.72,00:56:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you send it? 
I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:32.82,00:56:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Where has it been for the last seven 
years?
Dialogue: 0,00:56:34.99,00:56:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:36.56,00:56:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,"I don't know," is not good enough, 
doctor.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:38.66,00:56:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be 
the fucking expert.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:40.56,00:56:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I need answers. That's your job.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:42.83,00:56:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the other place, 
where is that?
Dialogue: 0,00:56:44.67,00:56:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know! I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,00:56:47.34,00:56:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,00:56:49.37,00:56:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a lot of things happening 
around here that I don't fully understand.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:52.67,00:56:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I need time.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:56.25,00:56:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:58.05,00:57:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's exactly 
what we don't have, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,00:57:06.52,00:57:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Corrick: Captain!
Dialogue: 0,00:57:14.06,00:57:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,00:57:22.07,00:57:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,00:57:29.21,00:57:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,00:57:33.75,00:57:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,For god's sakes, help me!
Dialogue: 0,00:57:47.73,00:57:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in your head.
Dialogue: 0,00:57:52.07,00:57:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just in your head.
Dialogue: 0,00:58:13.86,00:58:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,God help us.
Dialogue: 0,00:58:21.10,00:58:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: I'm telling you, 
it was his voice I heard.
Dialogue: 0,00:58:23.53,00:58:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He was calling to me.
Dialogue: 0,00:58:24.87,00:58:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A young bosun 
named Eddie corrick.
Dialogue: 0,00:58:29.17,00:58:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We served on 
the Goliath together.
Dialogue: 0,00:58:33.11,00:58:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,When the O2 tanks ruptured, four of 
us made it to the lifeboat.
Dialogue: 0,00:58:37.38,00:58:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But corrick was still 
on board the Goliath
Dialogue: 0,00:58:39.01,00:58:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,when the fire broke out.
Dialogue: 0,00:58:42.12,00:58:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You ever seen 
fire in zero gravity?
Dialogue: 0,00:58:46.72,00:58:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,00:58:50.39,00:58:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like liquid.
Dialogue: 0,00:58:53.20,00:58:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It slides all over everything.
Dialogue: 0,00:58:56.70,00:58:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Comes up in waves.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:00.00,00:59:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And they just kept hitting him,
Dialogue: 0,00:59:02.91,00:59:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,wave after wave.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:06.81,00:59:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He was screaming 
for me to save him.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:10.51,00:59:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,00:59:12.58,00:59:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I did the only thing I could.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:16.92,00:59:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I closed the lifeboat hatch, 
and I left him behind.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:24.39,00:59:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I swore I'd never 
lose another man.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:28.40,00:59:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've known you a long time.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:30.90,00:59:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You never told me that.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:32.17,00:59:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just it, d.J., 
I... I never told anybody.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:36.71,00:59:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But this ship knew about it.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:39.78,00:59:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It knows my fears. 
It knows my secrets.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:44.58,00:59:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Gets inside your head, 
and it shows you.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:48.85,00:59:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't going to tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:53.22,00:59:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been listening 
to the distress signal.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:56.43,00:59:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And I, um...
Dialogue: 0,01:00:00.03,01:00:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I made a mistake 
in the translation.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:11.77,01:00:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:14.44,01:00:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it said "liberate me."
Dialogue: 0,01:00:17.41,01:00:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,"Save me."
Dialogue: 0,01:00:20.08,01:00:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not "me."
Dialogue: 0,01:00:22.88,01:00:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's "liberate tutume."
Dialogue: 0,01:00:26.29,01:00:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,"Save yourself."
Dialogue: 0,01:00:28.79,01:00:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And it gets worse.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:34.26,01:00:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:36.77,01:00:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I think
Dialogue: 0,01:00:38.93,01:00:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,that says "ex inferis."
Dialogue: 0,01:00:43.57,01:00:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,"Save yourself
Dialogue: 0,01:00:47.64,01:00:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,"from hell."
Dialogue: 0,01:00:50.61,01:00:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, if what 
Dr. Weir tells us is true,
Dialogue: 0,01:00:55.48,01:00:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,this ship has been beyond the 
boundaries of our universe,
Dialogue: 0,01:00:59.45,01:01:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,of known scientific reality.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:03.09,01:01:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows where it's been,
Dialogue: 0,01:01:05.79,01:01:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,what it's seen,
Dialogue: 0,01:01:09.43,01:01:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and what 
it's brought back with it?
Dialogue: 0,01:01:12.33,01:01:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,From hell.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:17.94,01:01:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't believe in 
that kind of stuff, do you?
Dialogue: 0,01:01:23.95,01:01:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever sent that message, 
he sure believes in hell.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:28.35,01:01:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Cooper: Captain Miller.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:34.52,01:01:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, Coop, 
it better be good.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:36.29,01:01:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Cooper: Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:37.83,01:01:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to repressurize the Clark and 
get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:40.23,01:01:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,On my way.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:46.40,01:01:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Come on, baby, 
don't let me down.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:56.34,01:01:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, baby. Papa's home.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:00.02,01:02:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Smith: She's holding.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:02.65,01:02:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:04.09,01:02:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Cooper: Skipper, we're still venting 
trace gasses.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:07.02,01:02:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me about 20 minutes 
to plug the hole.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:09.02,01:02:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Cooper, 
you are the lifesaver.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:11.99,01:02:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,20 minutes and we're underway.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:17.67,01:02:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:22.20,01:02:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Got any coffee?
Dialogue: 0,01:02:24.01,01:02:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:25.94,01:02:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:37.55,01:02:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:44.29,01:02:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller?
Dialogue: 0,01:03:06.31,01:03:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:10.82,01:03:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we can't leave.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:13.92,01:03:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Our orders are specific.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:15.72,01:03:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Rescue the crew, salvage what's left 
of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:18.59,01:03:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The crew is dead, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:20.40,01:03:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ship killed them.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:21.46,01:03:22.100,Default,,0,0,0,,We came here to do a job.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:23.10,01:03:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We're aborting, doctor!
Dialogue: 0,01:03:25.63,01:03:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck, download the files from the 
event horizon's computers.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:28.97,01:03:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,D.j., I want you to get Justin
Dialogue: 0,01:03:31.07,01:03:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,prepped and ready to move him back to 
the Clark.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:32.57,01:03:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There's stuff I wanna 
get from medical.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:34.34,01:03:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd better move him in the tank. No 
problem. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:38.81,01:03:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Peters. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:40.28,01:03:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to get the co2 scrubbers 
back into the Clark.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:42.08,01:03:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Take smitty with you. Right.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:44.49,01:03:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Weir: Captain.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:47.46,01:03:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:51.09,01:03:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:53.13,01:03:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's done.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:56.20,01:03:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What about my ship? 
You can't just leave her.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:58.13,01:03:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of 
leaving her, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:59.87,01:04:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I will take the Lewis & Clark 
to a safe distance
Dialogue: 0,01:04:01.97,01:04:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and then I will launch tac missiles 
at the event horizon
Dialogue: 0,01:04:04.34,01:04:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,until I'm satisfied she's vaporized. 
Fuck this ship.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:15.95,01:04:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Miller, the bio—scan just 
went off the scale.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:18.89,01:04:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like the core
Dialogue: 0,01:04:20.79,01:04:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,is draining power 
from the rest of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:23.29,01:04:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the files. Vacate.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:24.86,01:04:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I want off this ship.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:26.33,01:04:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't leave. 
She won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:30.13,01:04:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You just get your gear and get back 
on the Lewis & Clark, doctor
Dialogue: 0,01:04:32.70,01:04:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,or you'll find 
yourself walkin' home.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:34.67,01:04:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I am home.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:37.14,01:04:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Peters: Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,01:04:39.01,01:04:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,01:04:41.58,01:04:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,D.j.: Shot.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:43.81,01:04:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Peters: Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:46.25,01:04:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready? Shot.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:53.05,01:04:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Shot. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:55.19,01:04:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Peters, can we go? This place is 
really freaking me out.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:57.49,01:04:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you wanna breathe 
on the way home.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:59.03,01:05:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,01:05:00.50,01:05:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,01:05:01.93,01:05:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,25. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,01:05:03.40,01:05:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We need 25. Peters!
Dialogue: 0,01:05:05.50,01:05:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Got it!
Dialogue: 0,01:07:32.41,01:07:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Peters.
Dialogue: 0,01:07:40.42,01:07:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,01:07:47.100,01:07:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Claire: Billy.
Dialogue: 0,01:07:59.17,01:08:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Claire?
Dialogue: 0,01:08:07.72,01:08:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Claire.
Dialogue: 0,01:08:10.62,01:08:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me. I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,01:08:14.79,01:08:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,01:08:20.26,01:08:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I wasn't there 
when you needed me,
Dialogue: 0,01:08:24.10,01:08:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm sorry I...
Dialogue: 0,01:08:26.90,01:08:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I let my work come between us.
Dialogue: 0,01:08:34.28,01:08:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,God, Claire, no.
Dialogue: 0,01:08:37.11,01:08:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, please. 
Please, don't.
Dialogue: 0,01:08:41.12,01:08:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again, please.
Dialogue: 0,01:08:43.65,01:08:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been so...
Dialogue: 0,01:08:50.49,01:08:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been so...
Dialogue: 0,01:08:54.46,01:08:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Claire: Billy.
Dialogue: 0,01:08:57.13,01:08:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:01.64,01:09:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been so alone.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:03.27,01:09:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never be alone again.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:06.81,01:09:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're with me now. 
You're with me
Dialogue: 0,01:09:11.48,01:09:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and I have such wonderful, 
wonderful things
Dialogue: 0,01:09:16.58,01:09:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,to show you.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:36.87,01:09:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:41.71,01:09:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Coop.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:43.18,01:09:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Coop, how long 
are you going to take?
Dialogue: 0,01:09:45.15,01:09:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause I've got to get 
the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:46.85,01:09:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you can kiss my ass, Smith, 
'cause I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:49.52,01:09:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me a second 
to collect my tools
Dialogue: 0,01:09:51.85,01:09:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and we can get out of dodge.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:53.29,01:09:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Two minutes tops.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:54.66,01:09:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:01.66,01:10:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Smith: Weir.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:03.13,01:10:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Weir.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:05.13,01:10:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Weir!
Dialogue: 0,01:10:09.34,01:10:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Weir!
Dialogue: 0,01:10:12.57,01:10:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Weir, get your ass 
back on board now!
Dialogue: 0,01:10:14.88,01:10:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Weir!
Dialogue: 0,01:10:17.38,01:10:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:19.38,01:10:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Miller, captain Miller, do 
you copy? Over.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:21.65,01:10:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Miller. Captain Miller, do 
you copy? Over.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:24.35,01:10:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, smitty.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:25.85,01:10:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've just seen Weir messing around on 
the Clark, sir.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:30.69,01:10:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Standby, smitty, 
I wanna check something out.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:38.73,01:10:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Smith, get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:40.03,01:10:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come again, sir?
Dialogue: 0,01:10:41.54,01:10:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the explosives 
is missing from the corridor.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:43.37,01:10:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Weir might have 
put it on the Clark.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:44.71,01:10:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No. No way.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:45.87,01:10:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, sir, no way.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:47.24,01:10:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I've just put it 
back together, sir.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:48.51,01:10:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off the Clark now, Smith!
Dialogue: 0,01:11:00.05,01:11:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the fucking hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,01:11:24.78,01:11:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Got you.
Dialogue: 0,01:11:26.45,01:11:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Hang on, smitty. 
I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,01:11:42.26,01:11:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,01:11:50.31,01:11:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,01:12:34.32,01:12:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Cooper: Shit!
Dialogue: 0,01:12:35.85,01:12:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the fuck am I going?
Dialogue: 0,01:12:37.32,01:12:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does this shit 
got to happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,01:12:39.19,01:12:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,01:12:42.62,01:12:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, think, Coop. 
Think. Think.
Dialogue: 0,01:12:44.56,01:12:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, all right, I got to get 
back to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,01:12:46.86,01:12:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I got to get back to the ship, all 
right.
Dialogue: 0,01:12:48.86,01:12:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta blow my air tank.
Dialogue: 0,01:12:50.83,01:12:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll blow my air tank.
Dialogue: 0,01:12:54.17,01:12:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,01:12:55.64,01:12:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This better work. 
This shit better work.
Dialogue: 0,01:12:57.74,01:12:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Here I go. All right.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:00.01,01:13:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:01.81,01:13:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:04.15,01:13:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,01:13:07.68,01:13:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come, motherfuckers!
Dialogue: 0,01:13:17.06,01:13:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,D.j.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:19.36,01:13:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,01:13:20.43,01:13:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Clark's gone.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:22.53,01:13:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Smitty and Cooper are dead.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:24.20,01:13:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What the...
Dialogue: 0,01:13:25.67,01:13:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Weir. You spot him, you take 
him out.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:28.74,01:13:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:30.87,01:13:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, d.J.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:32.61,01:13:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about Weir.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:34.88,01:13:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:46.35,01:13:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,D.j.?
Dialogue: 0,01:14:00.23,01:14:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: D.J.? D.J., answer me!
Dialogue: 0,01:14:51.65,01:14:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Okay, Dr. Weir.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:58.09,01:15:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't wanna leave your ship?
Dialogue: 0,01:15:01.50,01:15:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You never will.
Dialogue: 0,01:16:02.19,01:16:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck.
Dialogue: 0,01:16:25.71,01:16:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,01:16:31.25,01:16:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,01:16:36.39,01:16:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,01:16:41.93,01:16:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy.
Dialogue: 0,01:16:58.58,01:17:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:02.42,01:17:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,01:17:04.45,01:17:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where we're going, 
we won't need eyes to see.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:08.49,01:17:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,01:17:10.59,01:17:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I created the event horizon 
to reach the stars.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:15.30,01:17:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But she's gone 
much, much farther than that.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:19.97,01:17:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She tore a hole in our universe,
Dialogue: 0,01:17:22.50,01:17:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,a gateway to another dimension.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:26.77,01:17:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A dimension of pure chaos,
Dialogue: 0,01:17:29.98,01:17:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,pure evil.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:32.95,01:17:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,When she crossed over, 
she was just a ship.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:36.25,01:17:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But when she came back,
Dialogue: 0,01:17:39.62,01:17:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,she was alive.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:43.32,01:17:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at her, Miller.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:46.46,01:17:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't she beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,01:17:49.63,01:17:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your beautiful ship 
killed its crew, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:54.84,01:17:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,01:17:57.84,01:18:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,now she has another crew.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:02.04,01:18:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now she has us.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:11.32,01:18:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think 
you're doing, doctor?
Dialogue: 0,01:18:14.36,01:18:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted to know 
where the ship has been,
Dialogue: 0,01:18:17.83,01:18:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,so now you'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:33.84,01:18:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If you miss me, 
you blow out the hull.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:36.21,01:18:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think I'll miss?
Dialogue: 0,01:18:39.91,01:18:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Cooper: That's right, I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,01:18:41.68,01:18:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm... oh, shit, 
I can't stop. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,01:18:44.32,01:18:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:48.49,01:18:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Who the fuck? Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,01:19:26.76,01:19:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller!
Dialogue: 0,01:20:26.42,01:20:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller! Miller!
Dialogue: 0,01:20:42.34,01:20:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your hand!
Dialogue: 0,01:20:52.45,01:20:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Come on!
Dialogue: 0,01:20:54.11,01:20:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,01:20:57.15,01:20:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving you.
Dialogue: 0,01:21:19.01,01:21:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Fonnard airlock.
Dialogue: 0,01:21:26.15,01:21:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be Weir.
Dialogue: 0,01:21:28.75,01:21:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not taking any chances.
Dialogue: 0,01:21:31.52,01:21:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,01:21:44.16,01:21:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo! Don't hit me.
Dialogue: 0,01:21:45.20,01:21:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck: Cooper!
Dialogue: 0,01:21:46.67,01:21:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it off! Take it off!
Dialogue: 0,01:21:50.37,01:21:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe. 
I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,01:21:52.07,01:21:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're okay. You're okay. 
It's over.
Dialogue: 0,01:21:54.71,01:21:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,01:21:56.74,01:21:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Weir's activated 
the gravity drive.
Dialogue: 0,01:21:58.21,01:21:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta shut it down.
Dialogue: 0,01:21:59.55,01:22:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How? The bridge is gone. 
What about engineering?
Dialogue: 0,01:22:01.72,01:22:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can shut it down from 
there?
Dialogue: 0,01:22:03.08,01:22:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know the process. 
Dr. Weir was the expert.
Dialogue: 0,01:22:05.52,01:22:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to go where the other 
crew went, okay?
Dialogue: 0,01:22:07.39,01:22:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather be dead.
Dialogue: 0,01:22:08.89,01:22:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Okay, we blow 
the fucker up.
Dialogue: 0,01:22:10.39,01:22:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We blow it up?
Dialogue: 0,01:22:11.46,01:22:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do like Weir said. 
Blow the corridor,
Dialogue: 0,01:22:15.36,01:22:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,separate us from 
the rest of ship.
Dialogue: 0,01:22:17.90,01:22:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Use the foredecks as a lifeboat.
Dialogue: 0,01:22:19.73,01:22:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,With any luck, tdrs will pick up our 
emergency beacon.
Dialogue: 0,01:22:22.07,01:22:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We prep the gravity couches, 
put ourselves in stasis
Dialogue: 0,01:22:24.27,01:22:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and standby for 
a search and rescue team.
Dialogue: 0,01:22:26.24,01:22:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Meantime, I'm gonna go manually arm 
these explosives.
Dialogue: 0,01:22:28.78,01:22:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Skipper, will this shit work?
Dialogue: 0,01:22:30.48,01:22:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked for Dr. Weir. You go 
activate the emergency beacon.
Dialogue: 0,01:22:32.48,01:22:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You get back here double-quick.
Dialogue: 0,01:22:33.61,01:22:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. I'll come with you.
Dialogue: 0,01:22:35.15,01:22:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay here. You prep the gravity 
couches.
Dialogue: 0,01:22:37.28,01:22:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller.
Dialogue: 0,01:22:40.89,01:22:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Close this door 
behind me, lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,01:22:52.90,01:22:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Computer voice: Gateway opening in t 
minus five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,01:23:03.31,01:23:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Emergency beacon activated.
Dialogue: 0,01:23:07.61,01:23:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,01:23:09.62,01:23:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood?
Dialogue: 0,01:23:18.33,01:23:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, fuck me.
Dialogue: 0,01:23:20.59,01:23:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck me.
Dialogue: 0,01:23:22.96,01:23:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck!
Dialogue: 0,01:23:47.86,01:23:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck!
Dialogue: 0,01:23:53.33,01:23:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,01:23:57.36,01:24:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Computer voice: Gateway opening in t 
minus three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,01:24:05.67,01:24:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Detonator release is authorized.
Dialogue: 0,01:24:09.64,01:24:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The main corridor is now armed.
Dialogue: 0,01:24:12.68,01:24:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're armed. 
She's ready to blow.
Dialogue: 0,01:24:15.15,01:24:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I repeat, we are armed. 
She's ready to blow.
Dialogue: 0,01:24:18.55,01:24:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller. Miller, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,01:24:20.99,01:24:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,01:24:25.69,01:24:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You let me burn.
Dialogue: 0,01:24:45.08,01:24:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Computer voice: Gateway opening in t 
minus two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,01:25:06.27,01:25:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Corrick: Miller.
Dialogue: 0,01:25:26.75,01:25:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Corrick: You left me behind.
Dialogue: 0,01:25:31.09,01:25:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're not Edmund corrick.
Dialogue: 0,01:25:32.59,01:25:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I watched him die.
Dialogue: 0,01:25:38.57,01:25:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Weir?
Dialogue: 0,01:25:42.44,01:25:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship brought me back.
Dialogue: 0,01:25:44.61,01:25:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you 
she won't let me leave.
Dialogue: 0,01:25:46.61,01:25:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She won't let anyoneleave.
Dialogue: 0,01:25:48.78,01:25:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really think 
you could destroy this ship?
Dialogue: 0,01:25:52.11,01:25:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She's defied space and time.
Dialogue: 0,01:25:55.65,01:25:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been to a place you couldn't 
possibly imagine.
Dialogue: 0,01:25:59.29,01:26:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And now
Dialogue: 0,01:26:01.46,01:26:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,it is time to go back.
Dialogue: 0,01:26:03.62,01:26:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, to hell.
Dialogue: 0,01:26:05.79,01:26:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You know nothing. 
Hell is only a word.
Dialogue: 0,01:26:09.76,01:26:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The reality is much, much worse.
Dialogue: 0,01:26:16.64,01:26:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,01:26:21.01,01:26:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,01:26:25.65,01:26:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,01:26:29.52,01:26:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,01:26:31.32,01:26:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,01:26:33.15,01:26:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not dead. 
They're not dead.
Dialogue: 0,01:26:36.82,01:26:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,01:26:40.39,01:26:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't
Dialogue: 0,01:26:42.03,01:26:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,take my crew.
Dialogue: 0,01:27:05.05,01:27:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not your crew anymore.
Dialogue: 0,01:27:07.02,01:27:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They belong to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,01:27:09.02,01:27:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Computer voice: Gateway opening.
Dialogue: 0,01:27:25.34,01:27:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller: Take me.
Dialogue: 0,01:27:27.71,01:27:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You take me. 
You leave them alone.
Dialogue: 0,01:27:29.51,01:27:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No. There is no escape.
Dialogue: 0,01:27:35.35,01:27:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The gateway is open
Dialogue: 0,01:27:37.25,01:27:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and you are all coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,01:27:44.89,01:27:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see?
Dialogue: 0,01:27:50.86,01:27:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see?
Dialogue: 0,01:27:54.87,01:27:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see?
Dialogue: 0,01:27:58.91,01:28:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,01:28:01.61,01:28:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,01:28:06.75,01:28:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,01:29:29.23,01:29:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Miller.
Dialogue: 0,01:29:37.74,01:29:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Man: This is rescue one. We have 
contact.
Dialogue: 0,01:29:42.31,01:29:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Approaching the wreckage 
of the event horizon.
Dialogue: 0,01:29:45.75,01:29:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to board.
Dialogue: 0,01:29:56.92,01:29:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm entering the grav couch bay.
Dialogue: 0,01:29:59.99,01:30:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't appear to have been 
damaged in the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,01:30:05.53,01:30:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There appear to be 
three survivors,
Dialogue: 0,01:30:08.17,01:30:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Cooper, Justin, 
lieutenant starck.
Dialogue: 0,01:30:12.21,01:30:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin seems to have suffered 
massive injuries
Dialogue: 0,01:30:15.21,01:30:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,01:30:18.88,01:30:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The grav couches 
still have power.
Dialogue: 0,01:30:23.95,01:30:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm opening the first tank now.
Dialogue: 0,01:30:36.36,01:30:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,01:30:38.37,01:30:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,01:30:39.43,01:30:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Justin, Cooper.
Dialogue: 0,01:30:40.77,01:30:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They're fine. They're with us.
Dialogue: 0,01:30:44.20,01:30:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,They're with us.
Dialogue: 0,01:30:48.74,01:30:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Cooper: Starck. Starck.
Dialogue: 0,01:30:50.41,01:30:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay calm. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,01:30:51.78,01:30:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,01:30:52.91,01:30:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Breathe deeply.
Dialogue: 0,01:30:53.98,01:30:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck. Breathe deeply.
Dialogue: 0,01:30:55.42,01:30:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the rescue team. 
I need a sedative here, now!
Dialogue: 0,01:30:57.58,01:30:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you, starck. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,01:30:59.25,01:31:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,01:31:00.89,01:31:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a sedative here, now!
Dialogue: 0,01:31:02.42,01:31:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Starck, it's the rescue team. 
We're safe.
Dialogue: 0,01:31:04.49,01:31:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, I need it now!
Dialogue: 0,01:31:05.93,01:31:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Cooper: We're safe.
